  "issueDraft": {
    "title": "image list --output json emits non-JSON for an empty response and accepts invalid empty-result formats",
    "body": "AI-assisted research found the empty-result return in pkg/cmd/image/list.go precedes output-format dispatch. At CLI2.102.23, a controlled actual Cobra command yields No images found for an empty JSON response and succeeds for an invalid empty-result format. Removing only that guard reuses existing JSON/CSV writers and rejects invalid formats. Fourteen original/patched controls passed against the official generated protobuf transport, including two-page populated JSON/CSV, quoted CSV content, empty outputs and API denial. Empty JSON becomes null, preserving the existing nil slice writer; this is not an array-shape change. The interactive UI and real hosted registry were not rerun for this prototype. Source, patch, exact image/tool identities and raw controls are retained locally. No claim of human verification or maintainer acceptance."
  }
